D-NODEV measurement (2026-10-29): OPEN with a device-like name on a DISKLESS machine.

== program opn.bas
10 ON ERROR GOTO 900:N=0
20 N=1:T=TIME:OPEN "NUL:" FOR INPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
30 N=2:T=TIME:OPEN "XYZ:" FOR INPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
40 N=3:T=TIME:OPEN "NUL:" FOR OUTPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
50 N=4:T=TIME:OPEN "A:FOO" FOR INPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
60 N=5:T=TIME:OPEN "NU:" FOR INPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
70 N=6:T=TIME:OPEN "LPT:" FOR OUTPUT AS #1:LPRINT "CP";N;"OPENED":CLOSE
80 END
900 LPRINT "CP";N;"ERR";ERR;"FRAMES";(TIME-T)\10*10:RESUME NEXT

